venv/
instance/

# Secrets must never be sweepable by `git add -A`. A Tailscale OAuth
# secret was found sitting untracked in the working tree on 2026-10-14;
# nothing but habit was keeping it out of a commit.
# Test fixtures under tests/fixtures/ are deliberately committed throwaway
# keys for the age round-trip tests, so they are re-included below.
*.key
*.pem
*key*.txt
*secret*
*.age
!tests/fixtures/**
